            {
                "entry_id": "0cd594e3-c809-357a-b7fa-6d8d0fe1464c",
                "word": "candidate",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0818ee52-bc05-4423-8025-aeaa7a143642",
                        "entry_id": "0cd594e3-c809-357a-b7fa-6d8d0fe1464c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "candidates"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f574a428-6101-4688-a674-b0258e7ddb04",
                        "entry_id": "0cd594e3-c809-357a-b7fa-6d8d0fe1464c",
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "candidat"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "36c1f5eb-9d97-3729-b8da-5233783d2473",
                        "entry_id": "0cd594e3-c809-357a-b7fa-6d8d0fe1464c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celle qui se propose pour un poste, une récompense, etc. (quel que soit le statut de cette proposition)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7563f882-e846-4674-b433-cd1c92dc9ec4",
                                "sense_id": "36c1f5eb-9d97-3729-b8da-5233783d2473",
                                "text": "Il louait mademoiselle de Quinconas de sa collaboration intelligente et zélée, et, parcourant de son honnête regard les murs blanchis du petit oratoire, les pieuses images qui l’ornaient et l’auditoire rare et charmant, composé « premièrement, disait-il, d’une sainte gouvernante qui portera aux pieds de Dieu le mérite d’avoir soustrait une enfant aux embûches du siècle ; deuxièmement, de cette enfant, tabernacle de toutes les grâces, héritière des plus beaux biens de ce monde et candidate aux ineffables richesses de l’autre ; troisièmement, de mademoiselle Pomme d’Api, exemple de sagesse et de modération dans l’exubérance de la santé et de la belle mine ; quatrièmement, enfin, de cette chère bête, digne joujou de l’homme, et à qui il ne manque qu’une âme pour être notre sœur en gentillesse et en agilité », il élevait son âme vers le ciel et lui offrait avec une touchante sincérité son pur contentement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c42d2107-00d7-46df-b5cd-2eb01b0a29da",
                                "sense_id": "36c1f5eb-9d97-3729-b8da-5233783d2473",
                                "text": "Délicieux souvenirs de meetings aux salles combles, de discours émouvants de nos candidates novices (beaucoup s’exprimaient pour la première fois en public), du succès particulier auprès des médias étrangers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9284661c-9c3e-4922-8638-a42ea04be00e",
                                "sense_id": "36c1f5eb-9d97-3729-b8da-5233783d2473",
                                "text": "En tête des sondages, avec 24,4 % des voix, on retrouve la candidate d’extrême droite — souvent considérée comme postfasciste — Giorgia Meloni et son parti Fratelli d’Italia. Ils ont de grandes chances de remporter l’élection via une coalition des droites, menée avec l’ancien président du Conseil, Silvio Berlusconi, et Matteo Salvini"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "344b22b0-5df8-4a1d-8893-2f8e4fb21904",
                        "source_entry_id": "0cd594e3-c809-357a-b7fa-6d8d0fe1464c",
                        "source_sense_id": "36c1f5eb-9d97-3729-b8da-5233783d2473",
                        "target_lang_word": "candidate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "candidate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ca2ecd6-441c-3caa-a28f-bc37f334c4a7",
                                        "entry_id": "e754979a-bc04-31b0-a3db-d9ba24166300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who seeks to be elected or appointed to a position or privilege."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e9be796-40fd-4ccd-91b5-ede5a2576ac4",
                                                "sense_id": "9ca2ecd6-441c-3caa-a28f-bc37f334c4a7",
                                                "text": "Smith announced he was the party's candidate for the next election."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cade507-7e60-4bc8-a71d-528fe93ecf0e",
                                                "sense_id": "9ca2ecd6-441c-3caa-a28f-bc37f334c4a7",
                                                "text": "All candidates who miss the deadline or make a spelling mistake in their applications are automatically rejected."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0ca6e15-b7d0-455d-8e74-3f637f20eef2",
                                                "sense_id": "9ca2ecd6-441c-3caa-a28f-bc37f334c4a7",
                                                "text": "Artiles, a Republican operative with a reputation for a foul mouth and sharp elbows, is accused of financing a sham candidate whose candidacy was intended to siphon votes from a legitimate Democratic candidate in a state Senate race in South Florida’s 37th District. The candidate has the same last name as then-Democratic incumbent Jose Javier Rodriguez but did not actively campaign for the seat and has since admitted being recruited as a spoiler."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fc663dc-0975-3237-90cc-81e1c81bf29d",
                                        "entry_id": "e754979a-bc04-31b0-a3db-d9ba24166300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is thought likely or worthy to gain a position or privilege."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e136daf-0d6f-3312-966f-fbb61e5780ad",
                                        "entry_id": "e754979a-bc04-31b0-a3db-d9ba24166300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A participant in an examination."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "daf6848d-db2b-4145-a690-fd1c6253ba0f",
                                                "sense_id": "0e136daf-0d6f-3312-966f-fbb61e5780ad",
                                                "text": "Candidates must remain silent for the entirety of the exam."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1f4511f-a210-3e17-b283-b8593b241bbe",
                                        "entry_id": "e754979a-bc04-31b0-a3db-d9ba24166300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something likely or suited to undergo or be chosen for a purpose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af148a21-83f7-4962-b36d-e2eeece97eca",
                                                "sense_id": "f1f4511f-a210-3e17-b283-b8593b241bbe",
                                                "text": "After being presented with various suitors, she decided none of the candidates were the kind of man she was looking for."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4c46bb6-919e-4b16-8c71-6396012a5cca",
                                                "sense_id": "f1f4511f-a210-3e17-b283-b8593b241bbe",
                                                "text": "In the past two years, NASA’s Kepler Space Telescope has located nearly 3,000 exoplanet candidates ranging from sub-Earth-sized minions to gas giants that dwarf our own Jupiter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "643e03ee-5c9f-3b6d-9de6-9c2e5700cab5",
                                        "entry_id": "e754979a-bc04-31b0-a3db-d9ba24166300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gene which may play a role in a given disease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "candidate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88b14ff8-617b-3390-a883-b5070ea29557",
                                        "entry_id": "80b4eb9d-6939-3f25-82dc-38c5da2e39bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To stand as a candidate for an office, typically for a religious one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfeb76cb-74b6-4658-a5c1-d3ed137003ce",
                                                "sense_id": "88b14ff8-617b-3390-a883-b5070ea29557",
                                                "text": "The matter of candidating for a pulpit is not a matter of difference between congregations and Rabbis, but between Rabbis themselves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8ef4275-3537-4da1-bcd5-d85d9e07c887",
                                                "sense_id": "88b14ff8-617b-3390-a883-b5070ea29557",
                                                "text": "Furthermore, the fact that a school principal has only been in a large school six weeks does not prevent his candidating for principal of a larger school with larger salary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f648d326-b4bc-4fe1-a2ca-335cd941486b",
                                                "sense_id": "88b14ff8-617b-3390-a883-b5070ea29557",
                                                "text": "The report Shaping the Future also gives a set of learning outcomes for those people candidating for ordained ministry. These were also agreed by the Methodist Conference."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cda88b50-8786-3ea0-89a6-405687d00fd8",
                                        "entry_id": "80b4eb9d-6939-3f25-82dc-38c5da2e39bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make or name (something) as a candidate (to be chosen or deemed suitable for a purpose)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "nonstandard",
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b5ad844-51e4-420e-90b1-fa78ffd2e315",
                                                "sense_id": "cda88b50-8786-3ea0-89a6-405687d00fd8",
                                                "text": "Performance comparison of solar energy conversion candidated for SPS. (From NASA, Lyndon B. Johnson Space Center, Houston 1977.)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ea04fb9-e9c4-4e8b-bf3b-3831850c4355",
                                                "sense_id": "cda88b50-8786-3ea0-89a6-405687d00fd8",
                                                "text": "In this program if a processor becomes idle, then all feasible activities requiring that kind of processor will be candidated for scheduling. If the number of candidates is more than the number of available processors, activities with higher priority ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bad22e8f-078c-4b2e-be79-6fa2a9c0ce5f",
                                                "sense_id": "cda88b50-8786-3ea0-89a6-405687d00fd8",
                                                "text": "Evaluate the maintenance costs of the software system in order to candidate it for evolution AA14. Evaluate the hardware platform used and the possibility of migrating the software system toward more economical platforms ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
